<title>USA: Sabre Group combines info tech divisions.</title>
<headline>Sabre Group combines info tech divisions.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabre Group Inc said on Thursday it would combine its two information technology divisions &quot;to facilitate growth plans.&quot;</p>
<p>The new division will bring together Sabre Decision Technolgies and Sabre Computer Services and will pool consulting, outsourcing and data center operations, the company said.</p>
<p>In 1996, the two divisions accounted for $500 million in revenues, Sabre said.</p>
